    "body": "DUNCAN 3 independent sandbox integration candidate. This replaces the superseded custom HQ-memory production path with a thin derived SALVADOR shadow consumer over the already-merged GitHub-native Permanent Archive V1.\n\nREUSE ONLY\n- existing ZB Permanent Archive V1 raw/event archive\n- existing Git/GitHub Actions runtime\n- existing immutable archive helpers (`_canonical_json`, `_write_once`)\n- Python stdlib glue only\n\nENFORCED LAWS\n- RESULT_READY != QC PASS\n- runtime evidence never self-promotes skill\n- same-runtime JINGO training evidence may produce FAILED/PARTIAL only\n- CRITICAL failure overrides aggregate pass count\n- same-runtime evidence cannot self-produce PROVEN or LOCKED\n- runtime events preserve prior skill state\n- state is reconstructed from append-only derived history in event sequence order\n- replay of an older event after newer evidence is deterministic/idempotent\n- raw Permanent Archive remains immutable source of truth\n- no owner-PC daemon, polling, new DB, vector server, model/prompt/canon/profile mutation\n\nTDD EVIDENCE\n- initial missing consumer RED: hq-validate 33243281608\n- critical-override RED: 33243444702\n- state-reconstruction RED: 33243500145\n- workflow activation RED: 33243567631\n- replay/idempotency RED: 33243654016\n\nFINAL EXACT HEAD\n`75760f616130fab9f16193de3666e0a5982d57fa`\n\nFRESH VERIFICATION\n- hq-validate run 33243684625 = SUCCESS\n- hq-schema = SUCCESS\n- hq-scope-guard = SUCCESS\n- hq-control-tower-integrity = SUCCESS\n- full unittest suite = 219 tests / OK\n- changed files = exactly 4 expected files\n\nSTATE\nSANDBOX_INTEGRATION_CANDIDATE = PASS\nPRODUCTION_ACTIVE = NO\nMERGED = NO\nDRAFT = YES\n\nNEXT GATE: separate merge/integration authorization. A real post-merge `issue_comment.created` event is required before claiming the derived shadow consumer is physically active on `main`/`zb-archive-v1`.",
